// Template for local co-development against a local SDK checkout.
// Not needed for a regular build — the published SDK from go.mod is used.
//
// Copy to go.work (which is gitignored — never commit it):
//     make dev-setup
// or manually:
//     go work init .
//     go work edit -replace github.com/itglobalcom/vstack-cloud-panel-sdk=../vstack-cloud-panel-sdk
//
// We use `replace` (not `use ../vstack-cloud-panel-sdk`) so the local checkout
// is always used regardless of the version pinned in go.mod.
//
// With this workspace, edits in ../vstack-cloud-panel-sdk are picked up by the
// provider immediately (go build / go test) — no `replace` in go.mod, nothing
// committed. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
go 1.25.12

use .

replace github.com/itglobalcom/vstack-cloud-panel-sdk => ../vstack-cloud-panel-sdk
